      "writtenOn": "2023-05-26T14:17:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thx for your input Ben. I intentionally left off the goma check because I don\u0027t believe that our GN config files use Goma. Maybe I\u0027m wrong here?? Setting `use_goma \u003d true` does not do a goma build and will fail with an `Undefined identifier` if that check is added. To avoid the error I\u0027d need to define use_goma in `BUILDCONFIG.gn` - which would be odd since it won\u0027t be used. There\u0027s a whole lot that I don\u0027t know about GN, so please LMK if that check should be added.\n\nRegarding the output. The plan is to create a dashboard like go/chrome-includes. This isn\u0027t for IWYU checking, but for reducing the \"total build size\" to improve build times.",
